# Everything in this repo is text and is checked in as LF. Git on Windows has
# core.autocrlf=true by default, which silently rewrote working copies to CRLF and
# made every diff look like the whole file changed. These rules pin the canonical
# line ending per type so the wire's commits (and human review) stay clean.
* text=auto
*.js      text eol=lf
*.mjs     text eol=lf
*.json    text eol=lf
*.ndjson  text eol=lf
*.md      text eol=lf
*.yml     text eol=lf
*.yaml    text eol=lf
*.toml    text eol=lf
*.tsv     text eol=lf
*.html    text eol=lf
*.css     text eol=lf